  "details": "1. Go to any world\n\nwhile in loading screen there is a low chance to get stuck (probably requieres small package lost). Your loading screen visually disapears but nothing else changes. I'm not loading avatars. i'm flying somewhere in air. No reaction on any inputs. Screenshot shows position in https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_266523e8-9161-40da-acd0-6bd82e075833 from when i got stuck there. \n\nLogs:\n\n* output_log_2024-03-28_09-51-19.txt (cutted version, https://gist.github.com/Hackebein/b0baa6a1a6b287210dddb65819f279be)\n\n* output_log_2024-03-28_09-51-19.txt (156MB, can be provided if needed)\n\n* output_log_2024-04-10_22-39-04.txt (70MB, can be provided if needed)",
